+# Native fibers reserve their stack in the CPU flexible pool, at FiberStack::StackBytes() (512 KiB,
+# upstream's size for its other PlayStation target, __OPENORBIS__; headless/fiber_stack.h), and the
+# context is made over the stack's own size. ThreadToFiber needs only context bookkeeping and
+# allocates no unused private stack.
